                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a586210e-e1d2-360f-b10d-45d1b6d8a01a",
                        "entry_id": "f1a615e6-ffb7-31a0-b745-492fc17943c3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of clothing, very loose-fitting, so as to hang away from the body."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "74153a3a-c5c6-4350-bb12-85efc0104621",
                                "sense_id": "a586210e-e1d2-360f-b10d-45d1b6d8a01a",
                                "text": "When the YSL designer finally got to present Sunday, after the show tent pitched on a race course had been deemed unsafe, he had a surprise in store: the longest, bell-bottom pants since the start of the 1970s — and the baggiest since rapper chic."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f2f2b1f-bb1f-4576-ad35-5f417cb93695",
                                "sense_id": "a586210e-e1d2-360f-b10d-45d1b6d8a01a",
                                "text": "The only way to safely avoid looking like a hipster, so far as I can tell, is to dress in oversize mesh jerseys bearing the logos of sports teams. Or to wear the blandest, baggiest, beige-est clothes possible, like a middle-aged tourist."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f20f0bb-df9e-4e45-9fd6-fcd06ea6bec9",
                                "sense_id": "a586210e-e1d2-360f-b10d-45d1b6d8a01a",
                                "text": "He’d made some of the company’s baggiest-ever pants in response, and even baggier ones were in the works."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "00b84bad-6945-3a71-aab9-e8c0ab267a04",
                        "entry_id": "f1a615e6-ffb7-31a0-b745-492fc17943c3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or relating to a British music genre of the 1980s and 1990s, influenced by Madchester and psychedelia and associated with baggy clothing."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "96d4ed55-f8de-4901-8264-6f8825e627f0",
                                "sense_id": "00b84bad-6945-3a71-aab9-e8c0ab267a04",
                                "text": "Pop historian Jon Savage listens to the best of the Stone Roses and their contemporaries – from Baby Ford to the Sabres of Paradise – and creates the perfect set of baggy playlists"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dfaeb008-c519-4aa7-b241-0190ca80dc76",
                                "sense_id": "00b84bad-6945-3a71-aab9-e8c0ab267a04",
                                "text": "The Birmingham band – now a five-piece after multi-instrumentalist James Balmont joined them – have ditched the loose and baggy guitar pop of 2013’s Where the Heaven Are We? in favour of psych-pop that contorts itself into pulsing Balearic acid house and motorik rhythms."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c54ff0dd-cc09-3dcd-a77b-ba12166a8af5",
                        "entry_id": "f1a615e6-ffb7-31a0-b745-492fc17943c3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of writing, etc.: overwrought; flabby; having too much padding."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "22f9f846-4064-4da9-8f8d-02249a2266fe",
                                "sense_id": "c54ff0dd-cc09-3dcd-a77b-ba12166a8af5",
                                "text": "a baggy book"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
